# {{.Title}}

A Constellation bridge in Go. Write workflow results into your system in `apply` and carry out approved
actions in `act` (main.go). Its name and settings are in `connector.json`.

    go mod tidy
    go test ./...
    go build -o {{.Name}} .
    constellation conformance -- ./{{.Name}}            # against the mock
    CONSTELLATION_API_KEY=<a key with predictions:read> ./{{.Name}}

On start it checks in; approve it on Integrations in Constellation. `CURSOR_FILE` (default cursor.txt) keeps
where it stopped, and the actions it carried out beside it, so a restart never acts twice.
Build the image with `docker build -t {{.Name}} .`.
